  "description": "ZIJSES crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H108 Eu8 N28 O60. From the CIF bond table, Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu1 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu5 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu6 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors; Eu7 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu8 (Eu) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.805-3.878 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.56-112.70°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H108Eu8N28O60. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 12 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
